      "overview": "Sophie Monk and Mike Goldstein are joined by everyone’s favourite Welsh funny man, Lloyd Langford. Together with the Prime Minister, the panel determine just how political we really are, while tackling the ethics of open-mouth chewers, big-date spenders, and whether it’s acceptable to break up with someone just before Christmas.",
