      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "2026-05-05T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "It’s time to tickle your funny bones and sink your teeth into your neighbour as we celebrate Fright Night in a special episode of The Hundred with Andy Lee. With 100 petrified Aussies on standby to answer the nation’s scariest questions, we’re joined by the devilish Mike Goldstein, the ghoulish Kate Langbroek and the monstrous Joel Creasey. Exploring who’s frozen during a crisis and how many of us afraid of dying, the Hundred discover who’s afraid of clowns and who’s had a life-or-death experience?",
